formed", "state": "session:DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}, "note": "the third transfer of this delivery carries delivery-tag again, with a value the first transfer's does not have: `delivery-tag.u1` says \"It is an error if the delivery-tag on a continuation transfer differs from the delivery-tag on the first transfer of a delivery\""}], "vector": "flow-negative-continuation-delivery-tag-differs"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:links.29", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:transfer.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:transfer/field:message-format.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:transfer/field:message-format.u1"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a legitimate two-transfer framing of the message, followed by a continuation whose message-format contradicts the first transfer's. The step above shows the same framing admitted with the field omitted (`message-format.1` lets a continuation omit it); carrying a *different* value is the error, and both artefacts must refuse it with amqp:invalid-field and the malformed class", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "link", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": true}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000001d02000001005312c0100aa1046c696e6b434240404040404043", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001d02000001005313c010074370000003e84370000003e8434343", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000002202000001005314c00b064343a003746167434041005375a00a667261676d", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005314c00706434040404041656e746564005377a10a", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001f02000001005314c0080643404052014041667261676d656e746564", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:invalid-field", "reason": "malformed", "state": "session:DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}, "note": "the third transfer of this delivery carries message-format again, with a value the first transfer's does not have: `message-format.u1` says \"It is an error if the message-format on a continuation transfer differs from the message-format on the first transfer of a delivery\""}], "vector": "flow-negative-continuation-message-format-differs"}
